(text "Miata ECU motherboard 1994-1995 (NA8). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 30a12a91-4378-4597-ac6e-f6a4251c21b1)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))